  Background server runs another Codex build
  The background server runs Codex 0.156.0, not this session's Codex 0.167.0.
  Its installation already holds Codex 0.167.0, so a restart switches it to this build.
  Restart may interrupt active or queued work in other chats.


› 1. Run without daemon this time
  2. Restart background server (recommended)
  3. Cancel
